<BES>
  <Analysis>
    <Title>PHP YARA Vulnerability Scanner Results – CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619 V7</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<p>PHP YARA Vulnerability Scanner Results V7. Use only with matching V7 scanners; scanner and analysis versions should match. Completed result files are retained during background scans.</p><p>On Mac, access-denied locations are skipped and recorded in scan.log. FALSE means no vulnerable PHP was found in accessible files; unreadable locations are not confirmed clear. Limits, engine errors and unverified PHP evidence still produce UNKNOWN.</p>]]></Description>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[if (version of client >= "9.5.7") then windows of operating system or (name of operating system starts with "Linux") or mac of operating system else false]]></Relevance>
    <Category>PHP Security Discovery</Category>
